" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"184\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">A: no win</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">reverse: Max did not win, so which cause?</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2119(B\u2096|A) = \u2119(A|B\u2096) \u2119(B\u2096) / \u2119(A)</text></svg>",
