    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-30304\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-30304)\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-30304)\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">minutes</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bbe^(\u2212\u03bbt)</text><path d=\"M24.0,32.0 L28.0,41.1 L32.1,49.2 L36.1,56.4 L40.2,62.7 L44.2,68.4 L48.2,73.3 L52.3,77.8 L56.3,81.7 L60.4,85.1 L64.4,88.2 L68.4,90.9 L72.5,93.3 L76.5,95.4 L80.6,97.3 L84.6,99.0 L88.6,100.5 L92.7,101.8 L96.7,103.0 L100.8,104.0 L104.8,104.9 L108.8,105.7 L112.9,106.4 L116.9,107.1 L121.0,107.6 L125.0,108.1 L129.0,108.6 L133.1,109.0 L137.1,109.3 L141.2,109.6 L145.2,109.9 L149.2,110.1 L153.3,110.3 L157.3,110.5 L161.4,110.7 L165.4,110.8 L169.4,111.0 L173.5,111.1 L177.5,111.2 L181.6,111.3 L185.6,111.4 L189.6,111.4 L193.7,111.5 L197.7,111.6 L201.8,111.6 L205.8,111.7 L209.8,111.7 L213.9,111.7 L217.9,111.8 L222.0,111.8 L226.0,111.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"112.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"91.9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"112.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"108.7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">t</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">t + s</text><path d=\"M70.0,62.0 L73.9,67.5 L77.8,72.4 L81.7,76.8 L85.6,80.7 L89.5,84.1 L93.4,87.2 L97.3,90.0 L101.2,92.4 L105.1,94.6 L109.0,96.5 L112.9,98.2 L116.8,99.7 L120.7,101.1 L124.6,102.3 L128.5,103.4 L132.4,104.3 L136.3,105.2 L140.2,105.9 L144.1,106.6 L148.0,107.2 L151.9,107.7 L155.8,108.2 L159.7,108.6 L163.6,109.0 L167.5,109.3 L171.4,109.6 L175.3,109.9 L179.2,110.1 L183.1,110.3 L187.0,110.5 L190.9,110.7 L194.8,110.8 L198.7,110.9 L202.6,111.1 L206.5,111.2 L210.4,111.3 L214.3,111.3 L218.2,111.4 L222.1,111.5 L226.0,111.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"123.16\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">dashed: no safety car for t min</text><text x=\"137.72\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">the same shape starts again</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2119(X > t + s | X > t) = e^(\u2212\u03bbs) = \u2119(X > s)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "The density \u03bbe^(\u2212\u03bbt) of the wait for a safety car. After t clean minutes, the dashed curve beyond t has the same shape: \u2119(X > t+s | X > t) = e^(\u2212\u03bbs) = \u2119(X > s).",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Density & Survival:</strong> $f_X(t) = \\lambda e^{-\\lambda t} \\mathbf{1}_{\\{t \\ge 0\\}}$ with survival function $\\mathbb{P}(X > t) = e^{-\\lambda t}$. Mean $\\mathbb{E}[X] = 1/\\lambda$, variance $\\operatorname{Var}(X) = 1/\\lambda^2$.",
      "<strong>Memoryless Invariant:</strong> $\\mathbb{P}(X > t + s \\mid X > t) = \\mathbb{P}(X > s)$ for all $s, t \\ge 0$. The item does not age or wear out over time.",
      "<strong>Unique Characterization:</strong> The Exponential distribution is the ONLY continuous distribution on $[0, \\infty)$ possessing memoryless property (Geometric is the only discrete one)."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\mathbb{P}(X > t + s \\mid X > t) = \\frac{e^{-\\lambda(t+s)}}{e^{-\\lambda t}} = e^{-\\lambda s} = \\mathbb{P}(X > s)$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>A safety car is never \u201cdue\u201d.</strong> Forty clean laps and the strategists say a safety car must be coming, so Red Bull waits to pit. If incidents happen at random, the next one is no closer than at the start: the clean laps buy you nothing.",
    "examTrap": "Applying the memoryless property to aging physical machinery (car engines, human organs). Most real systems exhibit wear-out (Weibull with shape k > 1), where hazard rate strictly increases.",
    "stmtKind": "THEOREM",
    "statement": "<b>Exponential distribution and memorylessness.</b> $X\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(\\lambda)$ has density $f_X(t)=\\lambda e^{-\\lambda t}$ for $t\\ge0$, so $\\mathbb P(X\\gt t)=e^{-\\lambda t}$. Then for all $s,t\\ge0$, $\\mathbb P(X\\gt t+s\\mid X\\gt t)=\\dfrac{e^{-\\lambda(t+s)}}{e^{-\\lambda t}}=e^{-\\lambda s}=\\mathbb P(X\\gt s)$. It is the only continuous distribution on $[0,\\infty)$ with this property (Ross 5.5).",
    "hint": "There has been no safety car for t minutes. What is the chance there is none for s more?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\lambda e^{-\\lambda t}$ = the waiting-time curve.</strong> Early incidents are most likely, and $\\lambda$ is how many safety cars per minute come on average.",
      "<strong>$\\mathbb P(X\\gt t)=e^{-\\lambda t}$ = still no safety car after $t$.</strong> Each extra minute multiplies this chance by the same factor.",
      "<strong>$\\mathbb P(X\\gt t+s\\mid X\\gt t)=\\mathbb P(X\\gt s)$ = no memory.</strong> A clean first hour changes nothing: the remaining wait for a safety car has the same law as at lights out."
    ],
