    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-30804\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">0</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">1</text><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1/(n+1)</text><text x=\"81\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1/(n+1)</text><text x=\"113\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1/(n+1)</text><text x=\"149\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1/(n+1)</text><text x=\"189\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1/(n+1)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">n incidents at uniform times cut the race into n+1 gaps</text><path d=\"M30.0,124.2 L33.6,123.6 L37.2,122.7 L40.8,121.6 L44.4,120.1 L48.0,118.4 L51.6,116.4 L55.2,113.9 L58.8,111.2 L62.4,108.1 L66.0,104.7 L69.6,101.2 L73.2,97.5 L76.8,93.9 L80.4,90.4 L84.0,87.2 L87.6,84.5 L91.2,82.3 L94.8,80.8 L98.4,80.1 L102.0,80.1 L105.6,81.0 L109.2,82.5 L112.8,84.8 L116.4,87.6 L120.0,90.8 L123.6,94.3 L127.2,97.9 L130.8,101.6 L134.4,105.1 L138.0,108.4 L141.6,111.5 L145.2,114.2 L148.8,116.6 L152.4,118.6 L156.0,120.3 L159.6,121.7 L163.2,122.8 L166.8,123.7 L170.4,124.3 L174.0,124.8 L177.6,125.2 L181.2,125.4 L184.8,125.6 L188.4,125.7 L192.0,125.8 L195.6,125.9 L199.2,125.9 L202.8,126.0 L206.4,126.0 L210.0,126.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"126\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">U\u208d\u2096\u208e ~ Beta(k, n \u2212 k + 1)</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\ud835\udd3c[U\u208d\u2096\u208e] = k/(n+1)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "n incidents cut the race [0,1] into n+1 gaps of mean 1/(n+1). The bump below is the Beta(k, n \u2212 k + 1) density of the k-th incident, with mean \ud835\udd3c[U\u208d\u2096\u208e] = k/(n+1).",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Beta Distribution Law:</strong> For $U_1, \\dots, U_n \\stackrel{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim} \\text{Uniform}(0, 1)$, $f_{U_{(k)}}(u) = \\frac{n!}{(k-1)!(n-k)!} u^{k-1} (1-u)^{n-k} \\sim \\text{Beta}(k, n - k + 1)$.",
      "<strong>Expected Position:</strong> $\\mathbb{E}[U_{(k)}] = \\frac{k}{n+1}$, and variance $\\operatorname{Var}(U_{(k)}) = \\frac{k(n - k + 1)}{(n+1)^2(n+2)}$.",
      "<strong>Equal Mean Spacings:</strong> The $n$ order statistics partition $[0, 1]$ into $(n+1)$ sub-intervals (spacings) whose expected lengths are all IDENTICAL: $\\mathbb{E}[D_i] = \\frac{1}{n+1}$."
    ],
    "math": "$$U_{(k)} \\sim \\text{Beta}(k, n - k + 1), \\qquad \\mathbb{E}[U_{(k)}] = \\frac{k}{n+1}, \\qquad \\operatorname{Var}(U_{(k)}) = \\frac{k(n - k + 1)}{(n+1)^2(n+2)}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Incidents spread across the race.</strong> With four incidents at random moments in a race, the first comes after about a fifth of the race, and every gap between them averages the same.",
    "examTrap": "Believing edge spacings 0 to U_{(1)} and U_{(n)} to 1 behave differently from interior spacings. All (n+1) spacings are identically distributed with expected length 1/(n+1).",
    "stmtKind": "THEOREM",
    "statement": "<b>Uniform order statistics.</b> If $U_i$ are i.i.d. $\\text{Uniform}(0,1)$, then $U_{(k)}\\sim\\mathrm{Beta}(k,n-k+1)$ with $\\mathbb E[U_{(k)}]=\\frac{k}{n+1}$. The $n+1$ spacings are identically distributed, each of mean $\\frac1{n+1}$ (Ross 6.6; Grimmett 4.14).",
    "hint": "If n incidents fall at random times in a race, where does the k-th one sit on average, and how big are the gaps?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\mathrm{Beta}(k,n-k+1)$ = the $k$-th incident's law.</strong> A bump with $k-1$ incidents to its left and $n-k$ to its right.",
      "<strong>$\\mathbb E[U_{(k)}]=\\frac k{n+1}$ = evenly spread on average.</strong> $n$ incidents cut the race into $n+1$ gaps; the $k$-th sits $k$ gaps along.",
      "<strong>All $n+1$ spacings alike.</strong> The gaps to the start and to the flag behave exactly like the interior gaps."
    ],
