    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-30901\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-30901)\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-30901)\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">x</text><path d=\"M24.0,95.5 L26.3,94.4 L28.6,93.2 L31.0,91.7 L33.3,90.1 L35.6,88.2 L37.9,86.2 L40.2,84.0 L42.6,81.6 L44.9,79.2 L47.2,76.6 L49.5,74.1 L51.8,71.5 L54.2,69.1 L56.5,66.9 L58.8,64.9 L61.1,63.1 L63.4,61.7 L65.8,60.7 L68.1,60.2 L70.4,60.0 L72.7,60.3 L75.0,61.0 L77.4,62.2 L79.7,63.7 L82.0,65.5 L84.3,67.6 L86.6,70.0 L89.0,72.4 L91.3,74.9 L93.6,77.5 L95.9,80.0 L98.2,82.5 L100.6,84.8 L102.9,86.9 L105.2,88.9 L107.5,90.7 L109.8,92.2 L112.2,93.6 L114.5,94.8 L116.8,95.8 L119.1,96.7 L121.4,97.4 L123.8,98.0 L126.1,98.4 L128.4,98.8 L130.7,99.1 L133.0,99.3 L135.4,99.5 L137.7,99.6 L140.0,99.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">fX(x)</text><path d=\"M70.0,97.0 L72.4,96.1 L74.8,95.2 L77.2,94.0 L79.6,92.6 L82.0,91.0 L84.4,89.2 L86.8,87.2 L89.2,85.0 L91.6,82.6 L94.0,80.1 L96.4,77.5 L98.8,74.9 L101.2,72.2 L103.6,69.7 L106.0,67.3 L108.4,65.2 L110.8,63.3 L113.2,61.9 L115.6,60.8 L118.0,60.2 L120.4,60.0 L122.8,60.3 L125.2,61.1 L127.6,62.3 L130.0,63.9 L132.4,65.9 L134.8,68.1 L137.2,70.5 L139.6,73.1 L142.0,75.7 L144.4,78.4 L146.8,81.0 L149.2,83.4 L151.6,85.7 L154.0,87.9 L156.4,89.8 L158.8,91.6 L161.2,93.1 L163.6,94.4 L166.0,95.5 L168.4,96.4 L170.8,97.2 L173.2,97.9 L175.6,98.4 L178.0,98.8 L180.4,99.1 L182.8,99.3 L185.2,99.5 L187.6,99.6 L190.0,99.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"119.52\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">fY(z \u2212 x), flipped and slid to z</text><polygon points=\"70.0,97.0 72.0,96.3 74.0,95.5 76.0,94.6 78.0,93.5 80.0,92.3 82.0,91.0 84.0,89.5 86.0,87.9 88.0,86.1 90.0,84.2 92.0,82.2 94.0,80.1 96.0,80.1 98.0,82.2 100.0,84.2 102.0,86.1 104.0,87.9 106.0,89.5 108.0,91.0 110.0,92.3 112.0,93.5 114.0,94.6 116.0,95.5 118.0,96.3 120.0,97.0 120.0,100.0 70.0,100.0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"52.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">z</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">f(z) = \u222b fX(x) fY(z \u2212 x) dx = overlap area at z</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">pit stop + traffic: slide one density over the other</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "The density fX of the pit-stop time and the density fY of the traffic loss, flipped and slid so that it sits at z. The shaded overlap is the integral \u222bfX(x)fY(z \u2212 x)dx, the density of the total time lost at z.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Continuous Convolution:</strong> For independent $X \\perp Y$, the density of $Z = X + Y$ is $(f_X * f_Y)(z) = \\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty f_X(x) f_Y(z - x)\\,dx$.",
      "<strong>Discrete Convolution:</strong> For independent integer RVs, $\\mathbb{P}(Z = k) = \\sum_{j=-\\infty}^\\infty \\mathbb{P}(X = j)\\,\\mathbb{P}(Y = k - j)$.",
      "<strong>Algebraic Properties:</strong> Convolution is commutative ($f_X * f_Y = f_Y * f_X$) and associative ($(f_X * f_Y) * f_W = f_X * (f_Y * f_W)$)."
    ],
    "math": "$$f_{X+Y}(z) = (f_X * f_Y)(z) = \\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty f_X(x) f_Y(z - x)\\,dx = \\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty f_X(z - y) f_Y(y)\\,dy$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Every way to lose 6 seconds.</strong> Max can lose 6 seconds as a 2 s stop plus 4 s in traffic, 2.5 + 3.5, 3 + 3, and so on. For each split you multiply the density of the stop and of the traffic, then add up all splits.",
    "examTrap": "Neglecting to adjust integration limits for non-negative variables! If X, Y \u2265 0, then 0 \u2264 x \u2264 z; integrating from -\u221e to \u221e without truncating limits produces severe calculation errors.",
    "stmtKind": "THEOREM",
    "statement": "<b>Convolution formula.</b> If $X,Y$ are independent with densities $f_X,f_Y$, then $X+Y$ has density $f_{X+Y}(z)=(f_X*f_Y)(z)=\\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty f_X(x)f_Y(z-x)\\,dx=\\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty f_X(z-y)f_Y(y)\\,dy$. For independent integer-valued $X,Y$, $p_{X+Y}(z)=\\sum_xp_X(x)p_Y(z-x)$ (Ross 6.3; Grimmett 4.8).",
    "hint": "The pit-stop time and the time lost in traffic after it are independent. How do you get the density of the total time lost from the two densities?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$f_X(x)$ = the chance density of one part being $x$.</strong> Say the pit stop takes $x$ seconds.",
      "<strong>$f_Y(z-x)$ = then the other part must be $z-x$.</strong> For the total time lost to be $z$, the traffic must make up the rest.",
      "<strong>$\\int\\ldots dx$ = add over every split of $z$.</strong> Add up all the ways the total $z$ can be split into a stop $x$ and traffic $z-x$; independence lets the two densities multiply."
    ],
