    "cardNumber": "01",
    "category": "SET LIMITS",
    "highlighterClass": "highlight-cyan",
    "title": "Limsup (Infinitely Often) vs Liminf (All But Finitely Often)",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-31601\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"24\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">A\u2099 = Max retires (DNF) in race n</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31601)\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"154\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">keeps coming back: DNF i.o.  \u2208 lim sup A\u2099</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31601)\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"154\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"6.159999999999997\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">from some race on always a DNF: all but finitely often  \u2208 lim inf A\u2099</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">lim sup A\u2099 = \u22c2\u2099 \u22c3\u2096\u2265\u2099 A\u2096</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">(lim sup A\u2099)\u1d9c = lim inf A\u2099\u1d9c</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Two records of races (black = DNF). The top one keeps returning: lim sup, a DNF infinitely often. The bottom is a DNF in every race from some point on: lim inf. Complements swap them.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Limsup Definition:</strong> $\\limsup_{n \\to \\infty} A_n \\triangleq \\bigcap_{n=1}^\\infty \\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty A_k = \\{A_n \\text{ i.o.}\\}$ (infinitely often). $\\omega \\in \\limsup A_n \\iff \\omega$ belongs to infinitely many $A_n$.",
      "<strong>Liminf Definition:</strong> $\\liminf_{n \\to \\infty} A_n \\triangleq \\bigcup_{n=1}^\\infty \\bigcap_{k=n}^\\infty A_k = \\{A_n \\text{ a.b.f.o.}\\}$ (all but finitely often). $\\omega \\in \\liminf A_n \\iff \\exists N$ such that $\\omega \\in A_n$ for all $n \\ge N$.",
      "<strong>De Morgan Duality:</strong> $(\\limsup A_n)^c = \\liminf A_n^c$. Furthermore, $\\liminf A_n \\subseteq \\limsup A_n$ always holds."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\limsup_{n \\to \\infty} A_n = \\bigcap_{n=1}^\\infty \\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty A_k = \\{A_n \\text{ i.o.}\\}, \\qquad \\left(\\limsup A_n\\right)^c = \\liminf A_n^c$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Does the bad luck ever stop?</strong> \u201cDNF infinitely often\u201d means however many seasons ahead you look, another retirement awaits. \u201cDNF from some race on\u201d means the car breaks in every single race from some point and never recovers.",
    "examTrap": "Swapping intersection and union! Limsup is intersection of unions (\u22c2 \u22c3); Liminf is union of intersections (\u22c3 \u22c2). Swapping them completely reverses their mathematical meaning.",
    "stmtKind": "DEFINITION",
    "statement": "<b>Limsup and liminf of events.</b> For events $A_n$, $\\limsup A_n=\\bigcap_{n=1}^\\infty\\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty A_k=\\{A_n\\text{ infinitely often}\\}$ and $\\liminf A_n=\\bigcup_{n=1}^\\infty\\bigcap_{k=n}^\\infty A_k=\\{A_n\\text{ for all but finitely many }n\\}$. Also $(\\limsup A_n)^c=\\liminf A_n^c$ (Grimmett 7.3; Durrett 2.3).",
    "hint": "How do you say \u201ca DNF in infinitely many races\u201d versus \u201ca DNF in all but finitely many races\u201d with unions and intersections?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\bigcup_{k\\ge n}A_k$ = a DNF in some race from $n$ on.</strong> Whatever race $n$ you start from, there is still a retirement ahead.",
      "<strong>$\\bigcap_n\\bigcup_{k\\ge n}A_k$ = this holds for every $n$.</strong> There is always a later DNF: the retirements never stop, that is, infinitely often.",
      "<strong>$\\bigcup_n\\bigcap_{k\\ge n}A_k$ = a DNF every race from some point on.</strong> Past some $n$, every race ends in retirement: all but finitely often. Complements swap the two."
    ],
