    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-31903\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"11.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">a</text><circle cx=\"90.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"11.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">b</text><circle cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"11.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"144\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">c</text><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"98.0\" r=\"11.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">d</text><circle cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"98.0\" r=\"11.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"144\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">e</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"79.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31903)\"/><line x1=\"79.0\" y1=\"44.0\" x2=\"47.0\" y2=\"44.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31903)\"/><line x1=\"101.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"133.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31903)\"/><line x1=\"144.0\" y1=\"52.0\" x2=\"144.0\" y2=\"86.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31903)\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"69\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">class {a, b}</text><text x=\"170.48000000000002\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">c \u2192 e: no way back</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">i \u2192 j \u21d4 P\u1d62\u2c7c\u207d\u207f\u207e > 0 for some n \u2265 0; i \u2194 j \u21d4 i \u2192 j and j \u2192 i</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">S splits into disjoint communicating classes C\u2096</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "States a and b reach each other: one class. State c is reachable from b but cannot return (think \u201cretired from the sport\u201d), so it is its own class. The classes split up the state space.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Accessibility ($i \\to j$):</strong> State $j$ is accessible from $i$ if $P_{ij}^{(n)} > 0$ for some $n \\ge 0$ (path of positive probability).",
      "<strong>Communication ($i \\leftrightarrow j$):</strong> States communicate if $i \\to j$ and $j \\to i$. Communication is an EQUIVALENCE RELATION (reflexive, symmetric, transitive).",
      "<strong>Class Partition & Irreducibility:</strong> State space $S$ partitions into disjoint communicating classes $C_k$. A chain is **irreducible** if it consists of exactly ONE communicating class."
    ],
    "math": "$$i \\to j \\iff \\exists n \\ge 0 \\text{ s.t. } P_{ij}^{(n)} > 0; \\qquad i \\leftrightarrow j \\iff i \\to j \\text{ and } j \\to i; \\qquad S = \\bigcup C_k$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Which results connect.</strong> From a win Max can drop to a podium and climb back, so those are one class. Add a state \u201cretired from the sport\u201d: he can get there, but never comes back, so it sits in a class of its own.",
    "examTrap": "Confusing 1-step transitions with accessibility! P_{ij} = 0 does NOT imply j is inaccessible from i; state j might be reached in 2, 3, or more hops (P_{ij}^{(n)} > 0).",
    "stmtKind": "DEFINITION",
    "statement": "<b>Accessibility and communication.</b> State $j$ is accessible from $i$, $i\\to j$, if $P^{(n)}_{ij}\\gt 0$ for some $n\\ge0$. States communicate, $i\\leftrightarrow j$, if $i\\to j$ and $j\\to i$. Communication is an equivalence relation, so the state space splits into disjoint classes: $S=\\bigcup_kC_k$ (Ross 4.3; Grimmett 6.2).",
    "hint": "Which results can lead to which, and which pairs can lead back to each other?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$i\\to j\\iff P^{(n)}_{ij}\\gt 0$ for some $n\\ge0$ = a path exists.</strong> There is a chain of possible race-to-race moves from $i$ to $j$.",
      "<strong>$i\\leftrightarrow j$ = a path both ways.</strong> Each can reach the other; this is reflexive, symmetric and transitive.",
      "<strong>$S=\\bigcup_kC_k$ = classes.</strong> The relation cuts the states into groups that talk among themselves; a class with no exit is closed."
    ],
